  "description": "PostgreSQL (Npgsql) persistence provider for Feedemy.KeyManagement. Provides PostgreSQL storage for key metadata, versions, labels, endorsements, idempotency records and the hash-chained audit log; the schema comes from the core package's host-run DatabaseMigrator. Platform-independent alternative to SQL Server.",
